{"id":"prepositions-0049","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 49","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Doctors say stress is a major cause ___ insomnia.","hint":"cause ___ sth","explanation":"the cause OF something."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They arrived ___ Rome at dawn.","hint":"arrive ___ (place), ___ (city)","explanation":"arrive IN towns, cities and countries; AT for buildings/points."},{"answer":"with","accept":["by"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m getting bored ___ watching the same series.","hint":"bored ___ sth","explanation":"bored WITH (or BY) something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Who is responsible ___ locking up?","hint":"responsible ___ sth","explanation":"responsible FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"between","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"What\u0027s the difference ___ these two phones?","hint":"difference ___ two things","explanation":"difference BETWEEN two things (difference IN price/size for the respect in which)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We\u0027ve been waiting ___ the bus for half an hour.","hint":"wait ___ sb/sth","explanation":"wait FOR somebody/something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They congratulated her ___ passing her driving test.","hint":"congratulate sb ___ sth","explanation":"congratulate somebody ON an achievement."},{"answer":"at","accept":["to"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He pointed ___ the tallest tower in the skyline.","hint":"point ___ sth","explanation":"point AT/TO something."}]}